# Build context for deploy/Dockerfile (context = the repository root).
# Keep the context small — but only exclude things the builder provably does
# not need: several crates `include_str!` files from their own directories
# (`crates/kevin-orchestrator/prompts/*.md`, `crates/kevin-config/assets/`),
# so nothing under `crates/` is filtered here.
.git
.jj
target/
**/target/
workspace/
thoughts/
.kevin/
.github/
plan/
docs/
testing/
.env
.env.*
.DS_Store
